==Trivia==
*Although the name of Yellow Nyanko Ranger's hammers (ヒャクジュウハンマー ''Hyakujū Hanmā'') literally translates to "Hundred-Beast Hammer", ''hyakujū'' (百獣) normally doesn't refer to exactly a hundred beasts, but to all or many kinds of beasts/animals. Given Yellow Nyanko Ranger's lion motif, this name is likely a reference to the idiom 百獣の王 ''hyakujū no ō'', which can literally be taken as "king of a hundred beasts", but is actually an idiom most commonly used in reference to the lion, king of the animal kingdom.

